    "title": "Washburn soccer earns No. 4 seed in NCAA Tournament - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrew Lind ,\n13 hours ago TOPEKA, Kan. (WIBW) - Washburn soccer is headed to the NCAA Tournament for the third straight year, earning the No. 4 seed in the Central Region. The Ichabods will face No. 5 Missouri Western on Friday, November 21 at 10 a.m. in Mankato, Minnesota. Washburn enters at 11-3-5, while Missouri... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
